# What `docker build -f api/Dockerfile .` may see from the repository (plan H0): only what the image copies.
# Everything else (data/, .env, backups, dbt, the archive, node_modules) never leaves the machine or the runner.
*
!api/pyproject.toml
!api/uv.lock
!api/league_lab_api/
!app/lib/
!app/pages/
!src/league_lab/
!blog/
!dfs/slates/
!web/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
web/.vite
